{"Title":"An Act relative to insurance benefits relating to relocation costs","BillNumber":"H1109","DocketNumber":"HD2248","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"JAP1","Name":"Jerald A. Parisella","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JAP1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T11:33:54.05"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"JAP1","Name":"Jerald A. Parisella","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JAP1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T11:33:54.05"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H1109/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Parisella of Beverly, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 1109) of Jerald A. Parisella relative to insurance benefits relating to relocation costs.  Financial Services.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 99 of chapter 175 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended by striking out, in lines 350-351, the words “up to a limit of seven hundred and fifty” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- which shall be no less than five thousand.\r\n\tSECTION 2. This act shall take effect upon its passage.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J11","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J11"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}